# Optional. Without it the globe uses NASA Blue Marble imagery only.
# With it, zooming in switches to Cesium ion satellite imagery and 3D terrain.
# Copy this file to .env.local and paste your token after the equals sign.
# Create the token at https://ion.cesium.com/tokens with only the
# "assets:read" scope, and restrict its allowed URLs to your site.
PUBLIC_CESIUM_ION_TOKEN=
